Lid-driven cavity centreline reference values at Re=100 (crates/cfdcraft-bench-ghia/data/ghia_re100.csv)
- MIT (Expat). Vendored from triscale-innov/LidJul.jl, validation/ghia_re100.csv, commit
e5354b7e5eb8567ac812c204338dba2cf0ef540c; the upstream notice is reproduced at the top of that file.
The values are from U. Ghia, K. N. Ghia and C. T. Shin, J. Comput. Phys. 48 (1982) 387-411, and were
checked against the Sandia SIERRA/Fuego Verification Manual v5.20.

